<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμᾰχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμᾰ-</span>,
		root of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμνω, τέτμημαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slice of fish</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόμος</span> being commonly employed of meat,
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				13
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				283
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				894
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.4.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				186.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				82.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεστρᾶν τεμάχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					339
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύννου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					12
				</span></i>
			 (anap.): later, generally, for <i>slices of meat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.6
			</span></i>; of fruit, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.11
			</span></i>: sg. in collective sense, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.76.15
			</span></i> (Olbia, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				3.587
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμάχη τῶν Ὁμήρου
				δείπνων</span> Aesch. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.347e
			</span></i>.</div>
